docs {
  # Forget Password
  
  Request an OTP to reset password. OTP will be sent to the registered email.
  
  ## Request Body
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `email` | string | **Required** | Registered email address |
  
  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "code": 201,
    "message": "Otp has been sent on your register email",
    "data": null
  }
  ```
  
  ## Notes
  - OTP is valid for 10 minutes
  - Default OTP in development: `112211`
  - Check your email for the OTP code
}
